  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munderover><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to (where,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes the fractional part function)",
